    {
      "name": "T2 草稿",
      "description": "照 T2 的驗收條件：建立、修改時夾帶合計、查看；黃小芳改不到、刪不掉陳志明的草稿；金額 0、負數與明天的日期存不進去。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "T2-1 陳志明建立草稿（380 元與 1,280 元）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"201 或 200：草稿建立成功\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,201]));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json(); const claim = (body && body.claim) || body;",
                  "if (claim && claim.id !== undefined) pm.collectionVariables.set('claimId', claim.id);",
                  "pm.test('合計由伺服器計算：1660', () => pm.expect(claim.total_amount).to.eql(1660));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token_chen}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/claims",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "claims"
              ]
            },
            "description": "預期：201（或 200）：建立一張草稿，合計 1660（伺服器計算）。回應的單號自動存成 {{claimId}}。\n\n身分：陳志明（Header 帶 {{token_chen}}，先送過「00 登入」）。\n\n網址與欄位以你的 API 為準：你的 Agent 做的路徑或欄位名稱不一樣時，照你的改。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Postman 測試：客戶拜訪\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"expense_date\": \"{{today}}\",\n      \"category\": \"交通\",\n      \"description\": \"拜訪客戶：內湖到新莊（計程車）\",\n      \"amount\": 380\n    },\n    {\n      \"expense_date\": \"{{today}}\",\n      \"category\": \"餐費\",\n      \"description\": \"與客戶午餐（客戶 2 人）\",\n      \"amount\": 1280\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "T2-2 陳志明修改草稿，夾帶 total_amount 99（AC-02）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200：修改成功\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json(); const claim = (body && body.claim) || body;",
                  "pm.test('合計仍是 1660，不是 99', () => pm.expect(claim.total_amount).to.eql(1660));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token_chen}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "claims",
                "{{claimId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "預期：200：修改成功，但合計仍是 1660（請求裡的 total_amount 不理會，由伺服器依明細計算）。\n\n身分：陳志明（Header 帶 {{token_chen}}，先送過「00 登入」）。\n\n網址與欄位以你的 API 為準：你的 Agent 做的路徑或欄位名稱不一樣時，照你的改。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Postman 測試：客戶拜訪\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"expense_date\": \"{{today}}\",\n      \"category\": \"交通\",\n      \"description\": \"拜訪客戶：內湖到新莊（計程車）\",\n      \"amount\": 380\n    },\n    {\n      \"expense_date\": \"{{today}}\",\n      \"category\": \"餐費\",\n      \"description\": \"與客戶午餐（客戶 2 人）\",\n      \"amount\": 1280\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_amount\": 99\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
